cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "3D-AR-Studio"
abstract: "Drop a full augmented-reality studio into any web page. Place any number of 3D models in your real room through the camera, generate new ones from a text prompt, arrange them, then share the scene as a link, a QR code, or a live room. WebXR + Quick Look + Scene Viewer, a free CC0 model library, and an MCP server for agents."
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirholas/3D-AR-Studio"
url: "https://three.ws"
authors:
